{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14397","headline":"去妇怨 · 戴叔伦","name":"去妇怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出户不敢啼，风悲日凄凄。\n心知恩义绝，谁忍分明别。\n下坂车辚辚，畏逢乡里亲。\n空持牀前幔，却寄家中人。\n忽辞王吉去，爲是秋胡死。\n若比今日情，烦冤不相似。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14397.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14397","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}